    "# Code Similarity Analysis: VidyaVichar MERN Implementations\n",
    "## Q1: 27 Team Implementations Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook performs comprehensive code similarity analysis across multiple MERN stack implementations.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Author:** Student Submission  \n",
    "**Date:** 2025-11-04"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Setup and Imports"
   ]
